MODULE: LaneExclusiveAdmitsAnyWaiter
TARGET: LaneExclusive
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the reserved lane admits any queued replay, so a user-tree replay can take the system lane
PERTURBS: LaneOpportunity

--- FIND
        /\ status[r] = "queued" /\ role[r] = "System" /\ LaneFree > 0
--- REPLACE
        /\ status[r] = "queued" /\ LaneFree > 0
--- END
